          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tTOWER HILL TL 00 SW    \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                     6/88                                    \tBlantyre and -                                       \tattached barn,                                        \t\tnext Tenements Farm GV                                      \tII 2 barns, now a house and barn attached. C17, conversion in later C20. Timber frames on brick sills with old red tiled roofs. House has exposed frame brick nogged, barn dark weatherboarded. A pair of barns joined at right angles, formerly of Tenements Farm. West barn now a 16 storeys house, of 4 structural bays with gabled former porch on W in 2nd bay from S, and rear aisle under a catslide roof. C20 rear gabled extension in same bay. 3 gabled dormers on eaves at W with 2-light flush lattice leaded casements. 3 3-light casements to ground floor below, the mid height rail with curved tension bracing above it. Inserted chimneys at N gable and at centre of building.  Gable shows inclined queen-post, clasped-purlin roof with diminished principals and one purlin each side. Wide framing and tension bracing. Similar structure to N barn, but W bay in domestic use. Formerly named The Cottage. Listing NGR: TL0375402496"
    }
  ],
